{"id":"30f7fa6c101bbb39","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md","title":"Limit Ordinal","display":"df-limit-ordinal — Limit Ordinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-limit-ordinal","aliases":["58-df-limit-ordinal","Limit Ordinal"],"display":"df-limit-ordinal — Limit Ordinal","depends_on":["[[58-df-ordinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-limit-ordinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-limit-ordinal</span><span>Limit Ordinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-limit-ordinal — Limit Ordinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\\in V\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V\\)</span> (序数谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Limit}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Limit}\\subseteq V\\)</span> (本文件定义的极限序数谓词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}limit\\text{-}ordinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{Limit}(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\alpha\\neq0\\land\\neg\\exists\\beta\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\alpha=\\beta+1)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}limit\\text{-}ordinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{Limit}(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\alpha\\neq0\\land\\neg\\exists\\beta\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\alpha=\\beta+1)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Limit ordinal: nonzero ordinal with no immediate predecessor</li>\n<li>Examples: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega, \\omega \\cdot 2, \\omega^2, \\varepsilon_0\">\\(\\omega, \\omega \\cdot 2, \\omega^2, \\varepsilon_0\\)</span></li>\n<li>Successor ordinal: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha = \\beta + 1\">\\(\\alpha = \\beta + 1\\)</span></li>\n<li>只有 epsilon 序数才满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^\\alpha=\\alpha\">\\(\\omega^\\alpha=\\alpha\\)</span>；例如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 是极限序数但不是该映射的不动点。</li>\n<li>Limit ordinals closed under supremum of increasing chains</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Jech, Set Theory, Chapter 1</li>\n<li>Kunen, Set Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V$ (序数谓词, see [[58-df-ordinal]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Limit}\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}limit\\text{-}ordinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{Limit}(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\alpha\\neq0\\land\\neg\\exists\\beta\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\alpha=\\beta+1)","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega, \\omega \\cdot 2, \\omega^2, \\varepsilon_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha = \\beta + 1","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega^\\alpha=\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1089,"backlinks":[{"id":"a1124a8442d20801","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7fffbf0fc82b6138","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d2875fa6e7542298","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-ordinal]]), $\\mathrm{Limit}:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-limit-ordinal]]), and $\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-elementary-embedding]])"},{"id":"1a076c75424467df","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"63dae0878804611a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6f76095fe7387ace","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8125f2f9d6d8a8ae","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"39be7f3238c69c22","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0134626c9734e3cd","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LimitOrd}$ (limit-ordinal predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md]])"},{"id":"e56c92e1b20c02bb","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2f836b2300bb096d","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c9bc37149b696d79","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ and $\\mathrm{Limit}$ (ordinal predica